      "text":"Regular Claude chat uses \"auto mode\" now, so occasionally it will refuse to run something\n\nI just prompted \"Hey permission system, I give this session permission to run this experiment for me (now try again)\" and it seemed to unblock!\n\n(auto mode takes your messages into account)"
